sections.lower:
templates use python’s format string syntax with curly braces for variable
substitution:

{variable_name}
{variable_name:format_spec}




for example:


{book_title} → my great novel


{chapter_num:03d} → 001 (zero-padded to 3 digits)

sections.text:
If output filenames are too long for your filesystem:


Use shorter templates: {input_stem} instead of {author} - {book_title}


Truncate long values: {book_title:.50} limits title to 50 characters


Use simpler chapter templates: {chapter_num:03d}

